The shortest path to a **real RoboBladez MVP** is not “finish every subsystem.” It is to make one complete vertical slice impossible to fake:

```text
PERSISTENT AGENTS
→ mechanical reveal
→ agents author reincarnations
→ sealed deterministic match
→ canonical replay/events
→ agent/daimon evolution
→ story
→ canonical visual assets
→ shot graph
→ control/keyframe generation
→ LTX-2.5
→ visual QA / retake
→ final MP4 + complete provenance bundle
```

You are much closer than it looks. The architecture already has most of these boxes; the job now is making the boundaries real and joining them.

