# Phase 9 — harden the visual asset system

Your `VisualSpec → VisualAsset → AssetLibrary → VisualForge` ontology is good and should stay.

Now enforce it.

## 9A. Version-aware resolution

Asset lookup must require:

```text
entity
asset_type
mechanical_version
visual_version
view
lifecycle stage where relevant
```

So:

```text
body R18
```

cannot reuse:

```text
body R17 visual
```

accidentally.

## 9B. Real content hashes

Store:

```text
manifest_digest
file_sha256
```

separately.

## 9C. Immutable conflict handling

If:

```text
same asset key
same digest
```

idempotent.

If:

```text
same asset key
different digest
```

raise:

```text
CanonConflictError
```

## 9D. Real supersession

```text
R17 visual
→ SUPERSEDED_BY
R18 visual
```

Never delete history.

