# Phase 17 — split QA into three layers

The current mock QA mostly proves binding, not rendered correctness.

Create:

## BindingQA

Deterministic.

Checks:

```text
exact event refs
exact asset refs
correct versions
correct winner constraints
renderer manifest exists
```

## VisualQA

Inspect actual rendered frames.

Checks:

```text
Boris resembles canonical Boris
Morty resembles canonical Morty
two competitors only
arena identity preserved
no major object mutation
```

Can use a multimodal model later.

## EventQA

Checks the generated video against event constraints:

```text
collision occurs
relative positions plausible
post-event direction matches
winner isn't reversed
```

For MVP, EventQA can be:

```text
multimodal model
+
manual approval fallback
```

Don't pretend it's deterministic.

