## The milestone that matters most

Don't define success as:

> “57 tests become 100 tests.”

Define it as:

```text
Boris and Morty exist before the match.

They inspect the same mechanical truth.

Each authors a different executable self.

Those exact selves are committed.

Those selves fight.

The result becomes immutable history.

That history changes the Agents.

The exact bodies/world that existed in that history resolve to canonical visual assets.

The exact important events generate constrained shots.

LTX renders those shots.

QA rejects contradictions.

A final video is assembled.

Every frame can be traced back to canon.
```

**When one command can do that, RoboBladez has a real MVP.**

After that, scale complexity rather than architecture.
